inputParameters.prompt:
Repair this parallel implementation plan. Preserve the requested behavior, but return a complete replacement plan that fixes every validator issue. Each subtask must have a unique lowercase kebab-case id, a non-empty description, and a non-empty list of exact repository-relative files. A file may belong to only one subtask. Do not add test commands; testing is outside plan validation. User instruction: ${workflow.input.instruction}

Current plan JSON: ${plan_repair_context.output.planJson}

Validator issues JSON: ${plan_repair_context.output.issuesJson}
